# Day File Convention

Every new **numbered** day of the 100 day series must follow this pattern.

**Next day is Day 39.** Continue Day 38, then Day 39, Day 40, … Day 100. Files:

```
days/day39.html
days/day40.html
...
days/day100.html
```

Do **not** add more Python bonus days. Python 1 to 9 is finished. See `python-bonus.mdc`.

## ADK stays last and unchanged

`days/adk.html` is **Building Agentic AI with ADK**. Keep that chapter as it is. Do not rewrite it, delete it, or move it before Day 38.

Place each new numbered day **after Day 38 (or the latest numbered day) and before ADK**:

```html
<div data-include='days/day38.html'></div>
<div data-include='days/day39.html'></div>
<div data-include='days/adk.html'></div>
```

Sidebar TOC: new Day N block after the previous numbered day, **before** the ADK block. Hero and footer become "Day N of 100 published".

Day 39 lesson numbers start at Day 38's last lesson plus 1, then **shift ADK up**. See `lesson-numbering.mdc`.

## 1. Create the day file

The file contains **only** the chapter-divider and lesson-card blocks.

```html
      <div class="chapter-divider reveal" id="chapter-day-39" data-chapter="day-39">
        <span class="chapter-divider__pill">Day 39</span>
        <h2 class="chapter-divider__title">Your Day Title Here</h2>
        <p class="chapter-divider__note">Short description of the day.</p>
      </div>

      <article class="lesson-card reveal" id="section-N" data-section="N" data-chapter="day-39">
        ...
      </article>
```

## 2. Add the placeholder in index.html

Inside `<main>`, add exactly one include after the previous numbered day, before ADK:

```html
      <div data-include='days/day39.html'></div>
```

**Never add new day content inline in index.html.**

## 3. What still goes in index.html

- Sidebar TOC for the new day (before the ADK TOC block)
- Hero and footer "Day N of 100 published"

## 4. What still goes in styles.css

```css
.chapter-divider[data-chapter="day-39"] { border-left-color: var(--chapter-day-39); }
.lesson-card[data-chapter="day-39"] { border-top-color: var(--chapter-day-39); }
```

After any `styles.css` change, run `embed-css.sh`.

## 5. Checklist

- [ ] `days/dayN.html` created with chapter-divider and lesson-cards
- [ ] Include added after the previous numbered day, before ADK
- [ ] Sidebar TOC added before the ADK block
- [ ] Hero and footer day count updated
- [ ] CSS color rules added; `embed-css.sh` run if CSS changed
- [ ] ADK chapter left in place and not rewritten
- [ ] No day content written inline in `index.html`
